WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.240
Last day with adverbs, and today you’re the editor.

00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:08.560
Some little words sound like they add a lot, but say nothing at all.

00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:11.120
Read each sentence without the extra word.

00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:13.250
If nothing is lost, cut it.

00:00:13.250 --> 00:00:16.040
If the verb feels weak, find a stronger one.
